@startuml g4_6_3_strategy_comparison
title Strategy Comparison & Trade-off Analysis Architecture (G.4.6.3)

skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentBorderColor #0F172A

package "Authoritative Strategy Pipeline (G.4.5)" {
    [StrategyOptimizer\n(G.4.5.5)] as Optimizer
    [RankingResult\n(Authoritative Ranking)] as RankingRes
}

package "View-Model Transformation Layer (G.4.6.1)" {
    [StrategyDashboardAdapter] as Adapter
}

package "Presentation & Trade-off UI Layer (G.4.6.3)" {
    [Strategy Leaderboard\n(G.4.6.2)] as Leaderboard
    [Selected Scenario IDs\n(st.session_state)] as SessionState
    [prepare_comparison_view_data] as ViewPrep
    
    package "Trade-off Visualizations" {
        [Race Time vs Fuel] as ChartFuel
        [Race Time vs Tire Wear] as ChartWear
        [Race Time vs Pit Stops] as ChartPit
        [Stint & Compound Distribution] as ChartStint
        [Fuel Trajectory] as ChartFuelTraj
        [Tire Wear Trajectory] as ChartWearTraj
    }
}

Optimizer --> RankingRes : Produces Top-K
RankingRes --> Adapter : Consumed Read-Only

Adapter --> Leaderboard : Supplies Leaderboard DF
Leaderboard --> SessionState : Exposes selected_scenario_id

SessionState --> ViewPrep : Passes scenario_ids (Max 4)
Adapter --> ViewPrep : Supplies metrics, stint & lap DF

ViewPrep --> ChartFuel : Render
ViewPrep --> ChartWear : Render
ViewPrep --> ChartPit : Render
ViewPrep --> ChartStint : Render
ViewPrep --> ChartFuelTraj : Render
ViewPrep --> ChartWearTraj : Render

note right of ViewPrep
  **PRESENTATION ONLY**
  * NO Re-ranking
  * NO Simulation
  * NO Constraint Validation
  * NO Optimization
  * NO ML / LLM
  * NO Database / API
end note

@enduml
